  "origin": {
    "kind": "new",
    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit. A signal model in the manner of the tine electric pianos of the seventies (a struck tine with a short inharmonic second mode, a tone bar that carries the sustain, an electromagnetic pickup modelled as the rate of change of a bell-shaped flux curve, a suitcase-style stereo tremolo); it uses no samples and is not a circuit model of any one instrument."
